{"schema":"tetris4d-archived-cross-mobility-terminal-timing-v1","selection":"Ten unique expanded training games already fixed by the endpoint audit, all naturally ended in physical top-out. Each game contributes once; no network counterfactuals or new games. The intervals describe these archives only.","provenance":{"earlier_audit":"survival-training.artifacts/cross-survival-24h/direct-weight-archived-decisions.json","earlier_audit_sha256":"bf0028937a8189c938b60cdeb0d2dcd4bf549e4ac49fff2d87d671eb572666ed","git":"c914684fe86f7155a5a1f3ee66e15b05ec106fb0","backend":"native","device":"CPU","numpy":"2.5.4","python":"3.12.3","source_sha256":{"tetris_cross_survival.py":"1340993d9b8659b8914c82a108a8a7779bb4b2f569946f5305338ec5a6172bfa","tetris_game_library.py":"8bc5ea4056d4a78cd7830a422a419124554462249c86c1bd3170cb1b1f8072bc","sparse_tetris_4d_optimized.py":"1dbc9f410eb1d556d0e77d12e0e2b6bdb6ae27b98c2e58f50ea38c6dcf26b916","native/libtetris4d_native.so":"848c0b7577c474c62b1ac40372ad637b33134434142481ee85b7c721b9a3bd56","models/trained-sigmoid.json":"9f8826a79bc5493e09ff5df083bb2ee4c2cd898363889a3308a01e4fa1564abb"}},"method":"t means placements already completed. N(t) counts all legal CROSS landing centers on board t independent of the actual next piece. At every t=0..L we count once, including the initial and the post-final terminal board. Every archive replays with final board hash verification. A terminal-suffix onset is the first t of the last uninterrupted states N(t)<=h ending at L; lead L-t counts subsequent moves, and lead zero means only the terminal board qualified. An upcrossing is N(t-1)<=h and N(t)>h, counted on t in (L-512,L] over exactly 512 completed moves. Timing is known across the full game; we report separately if it would precede the 512-move window. Medians are conventional equal-game medians, averaging the two middle values for an even count.","thresholds":[16,8,1,0],"games":[{"game_id":"4f39c4df0881424d9cd03a521a68b36336e23110f599ae69b7f3eeadf767c67